    <!-- Dialogs & Bike Guide (Symmetrical & Clean) -->
    <string name="guide_title">🏍️ Honda RoadSync Connection Guide</string>
    <string name="guide_message">Quick guide to connect H-Sync with your Honda motorcycle (PCX, ADV, Forza, Hornet, CB, Transalp, Rebel, etc.):\n\n📌 Step 1: Bluetooth Connection\nEnsure your phone is connected to your Honda bike and Helmet Intercom.\n\n📌 Step 2: Open Honda RoadSync\nOpen RoadSync app on your phone ➔ Go to Settings ➔ Music Source.\n\n📌 Step 3: Select Music Source\n• To use H-Sync (BitChord/custom player): Enable the H-Sync music player switch, then select \'Spotify\' (H-Sync) in RoadSync.\n• To use native whitelisted players: Turn off the H-Sync music player switch, then select native Spotify / YouTube Music / VLC directly in RoadSync.\n\n📌 Step 4: Ready to Ride\nHandlebar buttons (Play, Pause, Next, Prev) directly control music and track titles display cleanly on your TFT meter!</string>
    <string name="guide_btn_open">Open RoadSync Now</string>
    <string name="guide_btn_close">Close</string>
